  "sourceOfTruthNotes": "Unit A review candidate. Canonical learner content is workspace/index.html, course-data.js, main.js, state-store.js and scoped CSS/assets. Imported authoring JSON and both immutable ZIPs are evidence only. Runtime-rendered practice, vocabulary, video and saved-work nodes are Annotation only. Studio Edit and export remain disabled until exact-build readiness and teacher review. The two in-course formula images are rendered from the unchanged supplied PDF with scripts/prepare-science24-formula-sheet.cjs; page 2 is rotated and trimmed for reading. Question-level Textbook Practice crops, its browser overlay and its review manifest regenerate from the canonical textbook/page catalog with scripts/build-science24-textbook-practice.py. The overlay freezes the earlier page catalog as legacyBookQuestions so original saved page records remain visible and are never counted as replacement question work.",
